<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the ASU School of Music and for submitting your application. We noticed that you indicated that you will upload a recorded audition instead of performing an on-campus audition. The deadline to submit your recorded audition is February 1. Please follow the instructions below for submitting your recorded audition:</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">1. Review and prepare the audition requirements for your&nbsp;voice/instrument listed&nbsp;<a href="http://music.asu.edu/admissions/auditions/#auditionmaterials">here</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">2. Record each audition requirement in the acceptable digital&nbsp;format as&nbsp;<i>separate</i>&nbsp;files with clear labels. For example:Mozart_Concerto_Mvt_1</font></div><div><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span><b>Voice Applicants:&nbsp;</b>all auditions must be in video format: MPEG, MPG, MP4, MOV , AVI, WMV, M4V, VOB</font></div><div><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span><b>Instrumental Applicants:&nbsp;</b>auditions are acceptable in either video or audio format: MPEG, MPG, MP4, MOV, AVI, WMV, M4V, VOB, MP3, M4A, AIFF, WMA, WAV, AAC</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">3. Email&nbsp;<a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a>&nbsp;your recorded auditions files by&nbsp;<b>February 1</b>. If your files are too large to email, please use either Google Drive or Dropbox and send the link to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">Musicadmissions@asu.edu</a></font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial">***<b>Auditions submitted as CDs, DVDs, YouTube, or any other method not listed above will not be reviewed***</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><b>Attention: Music Therapy and Music Education Applicants:&nbsp;</b>If you selected Music Therapy or Music Education as your first choice degree program, you will need to complete an interview with the faculty via Skype or phone. A member from the faculty in Music Education or Music Therapy will be contacting you via email within the next two months to schedule an interview.</div><div><br></div><div>If you have any questions about your recorded audition please contact:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a>.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<font color="#ffcc00">School of Music</font></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Po Box 870405 | Tempe, AZ 85287-0405</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Phone: 480-965-5069</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><br></b></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>